{
  "framework": "nextjs",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "devCommand": "npm run dev",
  "installCommand": "npm install",
  "regions": ["iad1"],

  "functions": {
    "src/app/api/interview/route.ts": { "maxDuration": 30 },
    "src/app/api/apply/route.ts":     { "maxDuration": 20 },
    "src/app/api/notify/route.ts":    { "maxDuration": 15 },
    "src/app/api/health/route.ts":    { "maxDuration": 10 }
  },

  "crons": [
    {
      "path": "/api/notify?secret=REPLACE_WITH_NOTIFY_SECRET",
      "schedule": "0 13 * * *",
      "comment": "Daily 8 AM CST (13:00 UTC) — 24h email reminders for tomorrow's jobs"
    },
    {
      "path": "/api/archive?secret=REPLACE_WITH_ARCHIVE_SECRET",
      "schedule": "0 8 * * 0",
      "comment": "Weekly Sunday 3 AM CST (08:00 UTC) — move stale records to archive tables"
    }
  ],

  "env": {
    "NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL":       "@beeluxe-supabase-url",
    "NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY":  "@beeluxe-supabase-anon-key",
    "SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY":      "@beeluxe-supabase-service-role-key",
    "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY":              "@beeluxe-anthropic-key",
    "TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID":             "@beeluxe-twilio-sid",
    "TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN":              "@beeluxe-twilio-token",
    "TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER":            "@beeluxe-twilio-phone",
    "NOTIFY_SECRET":                  "@beeluxe-notify-secret",
    "SENTRY_DSN":                     "@beeluxe-sentry-dsn",
    "NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN":         "@beeluxe-sentry-dsn-public",
    "SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN":              "@beeluxe-sentry-auth-token",
    "GROQ_API_KEY":                   "@beeluxe-groq-api-key",
    "RESEND_API_KEY":                 "@beeluxe-resend-api-key",
    "RESEND_FROM_EMAIL":              "@beeluxe-resend-from-email",
    "NEXT_PUBLIC_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY":   "@beeluxe-vapid-public-key",
    "VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY":              "@beeluxe-vapid-private-key",
    "VAPID_SUBJECT":                  "@beeluxe-vapid-subject",
    "ARCHIVE_SECRET":                 "@beeluxe-archive-secret",
    "NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL":            "@beeluxe-app-url",
    "NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ENV":            "production",
    "NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA": "@vercel-git-commit-sha"
  },

  "_comment_env_separation": [
    "Vercel has three built-in environment tiers:",
    "  Production  — main branch → beeluxecleaners.com   (LIVE Twilio/Stripe keys)",
    "  Preview     — every PR    → *.vercel.app preview  (TEST keys, see below)",
    "  Development — local       → .env.local            (TEST keys, see .env.staging.example)",
    "",
    "In the Vercel dashboard, each secret above can be scoped to:",
    "  [x] Production  [x] Preview  [x] Development",
    "",
    "For staging (Preview deployments), create SEPARATE Vercel secrets with -staging suffix:",
    "  beeluxe-twilio-sid-staging     → Twilio TEST Account SID (starts with ACtest...)",
    "  beeluxe-anthropic-key-staging  → can share prod key (Anthropic has no test mode)",
    "  beeluxe-supabase-url-staging   → staging Supabase project URL",
    "",
    "Then in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables, set each var to use the",
    "-staging variant in Preview scope and the production variant in Production scope."
  ]
}
